stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: inserted in the business transaction
  PENDING --> PROCESSING: claim by compare-and-set, 60 s lease, attempts + 1
  PROCESSING --> SENT: publish succeeded
  PROCESSING --> PENDING: publish failed, backoff 2 s doubling, cap 300 s
  PROCESSING --> PROCESSING: lease expired, another relay re-claims
  PROCESSING --> FAILED: 8 attempts used or unreadable payload
  SENT --> [*]: purged after 7 days
  FAILED --> [*]: kept for inspection, no replay endpoint
